## Resolved mutable: m-veg-depth-rootcause

ROOT CAUSE: mapspinner gl-render.js:1124-1131 _hrwActive=(camDist>=R-2) is ALWAYS true at ground level -> the planet renders into _vdrsFbo (a depth-renderbuffer FBO) for half-res water, so its depth lands in the FBO NOT the shared CANVAS depth buffer spoint's scene renders against -> veg/entities have no planet depth to test -> trees draw over distant planet terrain (user 'vegetation drawing over everything' = 'trees over distant terrain'). FIX: TerrainBackdrop sets window.__halfResWater=false (default) so the planet renders direct-to-canvas with depth in the shared buffer. Live browser-witness: halfResWater=false confirmed, planet near/far 0.5/4504 shared. All veg/grass/impostor materials were already depthWrite:true/depthTest:true/transparent:false (eliminated as causes).